1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,031
Speaking, task one. Topic 16: Clothes. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer aloud.

2
00:00:09,733 --> 00:00:11,300
What are you wearing today?

3
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:20,292
Today I'm wearing jeans, a blue sweater and trainers.

4
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,150
What clothes do you wear to work?

5
00:00:28,567 --> 00:00:31,054
I wear work trousers and a T-shirt to work.

6
00:00:31,967 --> 00:00:33,754
What colour do you like best?

7
00:00:39,167 --> 00:00:41,507
I like blue and black best.

8
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,081
Where do you buy clothes?

9
00:00:49,467 --> 00:00:52,407
I buy clothes at a shopping centre or online.

10
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:54,562
What do you wear in winter?

11
00:00:59,967 --> 00:01:03,888
In winter I wear a warm jacket, a hat, a scarf and gloves.

12
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:06,700
Do you like wearing elegant clothes?

13
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:15,209
I wear elegant clothes only to a wedding or the theatre.

14
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:18,159
What clothes did you buy yourself last?

15
00:01:23,567 --> 00:01:25,628
The last thing I bought was a winter jacket.

16
00:01:26,533 --> 00:01:28,639
What did you wear at the last party?

17
00:01:34,033 --> 00:01:37,135
At the last party I wore a black suit and new shoes.

18
00:01:38,033 --> 00:01:39,499
What will you buy for spring?

19
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:47,500
For spring I'll buy a light jacket and new trainers.

20
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,389
What clothes would you never wear?

21
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:59,156
I would never wear very colourful clothes, I don't like them.

22
00:02:00,067 --> 00:02:09,932
